.TH ZDOTS-THEME-GEN 1 "2026-07-28" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-theme-gen \- zdots\-theme\-gen — generate every surface theme artifact from one palette source.
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-theme-gen --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
zdots-theme-gen — generate every surface theme artifact from one palette source.

Usage:
  zdots-theme-gen [slug]            generate all surfaces (default: kanagawa-wave)
  zdots-theme-gen [slug] --check    exit 1 if any artifact is stale vs source
  zdots-theme-gen [slug] --only F   generate only the output whose out: is F
  zdots-theme-gen --list            list configured schemes

Source of truth: etc/themes/<slug>.yaml. See docs/styleguide/colorschemes.md.
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
